@startuml EmailNotificationAPI_StateDiagram
!define ABOLD <b>
!define AEND </b>

title ABOLD Email Notification Service - Request State Diagram AEND

[*] --> ReceiveRequest: POST /email/save

ReceiveRequest --> ParseRequest: Parse JSON to\nApplicationEmailRequest
ParseRequest --> ValidateAppId: Extract appId

ValidateAppId --> AppIdNull: appId == null?\nOR\nappId.isEmpty()?

AppIdNull --> ReturnError400: YES\nThrow ApplicationException\n(400)
AppIdNull --> ConvertEntity: NO

ReturnError400 --> SendError: Build ErrorResponse\nstatus: 400

ConvertEntity --> MapFields: Map request fields\nto IOrigNotification

MapFields --> CallRepository: Save to Repository
CallRepository --> DatabaseSave: Execute INSERT\nINTO IORIG_NOTIFICATION

DatabaseSave --> GenerateSequence: Generate INTF_SEQ_ID\n(via Sequence)
GenerateSequence --> GenerateTimestamp: Set INTF_CREATED_ON\n(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)

GenerateTimestamp --> WriteCLOB: Write content\nas CLOB\n(Hibernate LOB)

WriteCLOB --> DatabaseSuccess: Commit Transaction

DatabaseSuccess --> BuildResponse: Build\nEmailNotificationResponse

BuildResponse --> ReturnSuccess: Return HTTP 200 OK\n+ Response Body

DatabaseSuccess --> DatabaseError: Exception during\nINSERT?

DatabaseError --> ReturnError500: YES\nThrow RuntimeException

ReturnError500 --> SendError: Build ErrorResponse\nstatus: 500

SendError --> [*]
ReturnSuccess --> [*]

note right of ParseRequest
  Spring Web
  JSON deserialization
end note

note right of ValidateAppId
  DTO validation
end note

note right of AppIdNull
  Business Logic
  Validation
end note

note right of CallRepository
  Spring Data JPA
  Hibernate ORM
end note

note right of GenerateSequence
  Oracle Database
  Default values
end note

note right of WriteCLOB
  Hibernate CLOB
  Stream handling
end note

@enduml
